{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51763","headline":"遗诗 · 宋自然","name":"遗诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心是灵台神是室，口爲玉池生玉液。\n常将玉液溉灵台，流利关元滋百脉。\n百脉润，柯叶青，叶青柯润便长生。\n世人不会长生药，炼石烧丹劳尔形。\n（《茅亭客话》四）（〖1〗《全唐诗》无宋自然诗，兹据《茅亭客话》补其事迹：宋自然，长兴中遂州贫士，常於街市中行乞。\n孟知祥攻围遂州时，饿殍於州市。\n後有人云曾於潞州见之，又於其埋处得遗诗一纸。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋自然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}